<title>HONG KONG: ING sets Advanced Semiconductor warrants.</title>
<headline>ING sets Advanced Semiconductor warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings Financial Products said on Thursday it proposed to issue 110 million European-style call warrants linked to Advanced Semiconductor Engineering.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    US$1.70025     PREMIUM	 13.89 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     US$0.033808    GEARING	 5.29X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.NOV.97	LISTING	 LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT  US$1.79	  PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> NOTE		GOVERNING LAW IS ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
